{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/58b35996a5f9e7f423b66d48f7eb5cc6.poster.avif?t=1760741174\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/58b35996a5f9e7f423b66d48f7eb5cc6.webm?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/58b35996a5f9e7f423b66d48f7eb5cc6.mp4?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage I \u2013 The Main Quest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the crypt wall brick by brick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove that even a humble vampire worker may rise above.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how every step is a victory\u2026 until it isn\u2019t.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/4a18f7efeb496b8efb9b21dc55a0b0e3.poster.avif?t=1760741174\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/4a18f7efeb496b8efb9b21dc55a0b0e3.webm?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/4a18f7efeb496b8efb9b21dc55a0b0e3.mp4?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage II \u2013 The Side Quests</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your fellow workers with bizarre errands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mysterious items that may or may not be useful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets the foreman definitely didn\u2019t put in your contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage III \u2013 The Importance of Garlic</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaaaaaaarlic!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.poster.avif?t=1760741174\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.webm?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009080/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.mp4?t=1760741174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage IV \u2013 One Way\u2026 or Another</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the definitely safe, totally reliable path \u2013 aged gracefully over just a few centuries - to climb the crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or craft your very own questionable path, only a vampire could love.*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb, stumble, laugh**, repeat. Grab your trusty pocket-coffin \u2013 it\u2019s climbing time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*if rules are only a recommendation for you anyway</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>**and/or cry a little</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009080?t=1760741174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009080?t=1760741174